graph LR
    Installer[/.github/hooks/install-hooks.ps1/]:::ws
    WorkspaceRoot[Workspace checkout root<br/>resolved from $PSScriptRoot/../..]:::ws
    HooksCandidate[.github/hooks/scripts<br/>joined from checkout root]:::ws
    DirectoryGate{path exists and is a directory?}:::state
    CanonicalHooks[Resolved canonical hook path<br/>normalized for Git]:::ws
    InstallAbort[exit 1<br/>no repository config writes]:::state

    Installer -->|"resolve checkout root from script location"| WorkspaceRoot
    WorkspaceRoot -->|"Join-Path .github/hooks/scripts"| HooksCandidate
    HooksCandidate -->|"Test-Path -PathType Container"| DirectoryGate
    DirectoryGate -->|"valid: Resolve-Path and normalize before writes"| CanonicalHooks
    DirectoryGate -->|"missing or invalid: exit before config writes"| InstallAbort

    subgraph Targets["Six repository targets"]
        RepoWorkspace[⊕ Workspace]
        RepoLife[∞ Life]
        RepoMusic[❤ Music]
        RepoQuantum[⟨ψ⟩ Quantum]
        RepoManifest[👁 AI-Manifest]
        RepoCapital[Σ Capital]
    end

    CanonicalHooks -->|"if repo exists: set core.hooksPath and verify read-back"| RepoWorkspace
    CanonicalHooks -->|"if repo exists: set core.hooksPath and verify read-back"| RepoLife
    CanonicalHooks -->|"if repo exists: set core.hooksPath and verify read-back"| RepoMusic
    CanonicalHooks -->|"if repo exists: set core.hooksPath and verify read-back"| RepoQuantum
    CanonicalHooks -->|"if repo exists: set core.hooksPath and verify read-back"| RepoManifest
    CanonicalHooks -->|"if repo exists: set core.hooksPath and verify read-back"| RepoCapital

    CanonicalHooks -->|"shared directory selected by core.hooksPath"| PreCommit[shared pre-commit entrypoint]:::ws
    PreCommit --> WorktreeGuard[reject staged .worktrees/ paths]:::ws
    PreCommit --> SecretScan[scan added staged lines for secret patterns]:::ws
    PreCommit --> LifeGate{repository is ∞Life?}:::state
    LifeGate -->|"yes: run private-data audit"| PrivateDataAudit[block staged health, genomic, database, and private-key paths]:::ws

    class RepoWorkspace ws
    class RepoLife life
    class RepoMusic music
    class RepoQuantum quantum
    class RepoManifest manifest
    class RepoCapital capital

